# Web / Dashboard

- Follow `.cursorrules/ui.md` and `.cursorrules/stack.md` (web section).
- App Router + TypeScript; Server Components by default.
- Features: job feed, pitch drawer (copy cover/email/DM), asset URL manager.
- Render DB `generated_*` fields — do not re-generate pitches in the browser.
- Read `web/AGENTS.md` before using unfamiliar Next APIs (Next 16 may differ from training data).
- Optional HTTP endpoints: `web/app/api/**/route.ts` (App Router Route Handlers). Prefer Supabase for data access.
- No scrape or OpenAI scoring logic inside the Next app.
